          "id": "7b1fe7e5-1d09-4eaa-839a-1246a015a5cb",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "79fd5384-8f9e-43ff-bc9e-4de16ed8e114",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "...this working replica of one most treasured corner of <a href=\"#/about-the-editor-fd54d727\">my</a> brain, cultivated here in miniature so that one might <em>peruse &amp; gaze upon it all easily, share with others, &amp; to accelerate cross-propagation</em>."
            },
            {
              "id": "8a173d75-9ce2-4d13-864b-b90ef4fa6cbc",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "ff26707f-07a5-4358-9c32-6b286b946bbd",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Padiasophia Wiki </strong>is a research project intended toward collecting &amp; connecting many diverse approaches to thinking &amp; making about games/play."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0ddbe7ce-1942-4146-ab6a-e421ad6ddbad",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "e1553761-4073-4b3b-a430-ea762f341e2c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<u><strong>Updates</strong></u>"
            },
            {
              "id": "eb84c7fd-2045-4811-90ad-42dd393d515b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Most Recent:</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "65c9c625-45f9-46ff-ab48-b69b6a8257cc",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong><em>[11/4/22]</em></strong>::Slowly plugging away. Every existing book page (currently: 770) is complete with basic information as well as tags in the database, and i’ve amassed a folder w. 302 more just waiting to be added)! These represent a much larger swathe of approaches to the field than were represented previously; from more diverse historical accounts to formal leisure studies, mathematical &amp; scientific investigations to a(n admittedly still rather shallow) sampling of theories of/from sports. In the past weeks, major improvements have also been made to site aesthetics. Additional sections like <a href=\"#/quotes\">quotes</a>, <a href=\"#/images\">images</a>, &amp; <a href=\"#/other-sites\">other game/play sites</a> have been added, and in general things like <a href=\"#/lists-256bd3bc\">lists</a> and <a href=\"#/folks-292fe1df\">people</a> pages (or at least ideas for pages like on the <a href=\"#/concept-wall\">concept wall</a>) are getting a little more fleshed out."
            },
            {
              "id": "8bfc9653-0bfe-4146-b188-11d0b8693f51",
              "type": "toggle",
              "html": "<strong>Older...</strong>",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "9e3f0356-5634-43b4-b38f-00eae1e66a9d",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9b293cf9-adc6-4d52-a347-14875688b9d3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "751a87ae-8315-47ae-9ad0-55741b708843",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5bb15f3e-9369-41a4-892d-665e9c0eaa24",
      "type": "callout",
      "html": "<strong>disclaimer</strong>:: <em>this is a pleasure garden. the contents of these pages comprise no canon, nor pantheon, nor dictionary. the reader finds here but a representation of one distinct vision of play. there are admittedly parts intended toward a reflection of a broader field ecology (however singularly viewed), but there are many more indulgences &amp; exotics, grown here only according to the tender`s own experience &amp; curiosities.</em>",
      "icon": "🕯️",
      "children": []
